    "description": "Get one channel. Uses the fixed catalog operation get_channel; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:read. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): VIEW_CHANNEL for non-public target channels. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
