    "description": "List guild members with cursor pagination. Uses the fixed catalog operation list_guild_members; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:read. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): target-dependent; the pinned Discord OpenAPI does not declare a permission for this operation. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
