    "description": "List messages in a channel. Uses the fixed catalog operation list_messages; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:read. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): VIEW_CHANNEL and READ_MESSAGE_HISTORY. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
