      "openWorldHint": true,
      "readOnlyHint": false,
    },
    "description": "Crosspost a news-channel message. Uses the fixed catalog operation crosspost_message; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:write. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): VIEW_CHANNEL, SEND_MESSAGES, and MANAGE_MESSAGES. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
