    "description": "Kick a member from a guild. Uses the fixed catalog operation delete_guild_member; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:destructive. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): KICK_MEMBERS plus hierarchy eligibility. Destructive behavior: this can remove or replace Discord or persisted state; guarded Discord calls require an exact unexpired preview token. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
