    "description": "Create an AutoMod rule. Uses the fixed catalog operation create_auto_moderation_rule; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:write. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): MANAGE_GUILD. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
