    "description": "Delete an AutoMod rule. Uses the fixed catalog operation delete_auto_moderation_rule; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:destructive. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): MANAGE_GUILD. Destructive behavior: this can remove or replace Discord or persisted state; guarded Discord calls require an exact unexpired preview token. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
