    "description": "Create a channel invite. Uses the fixed catalog operation create_channel_invite; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:write. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): CREATE_INSTANT_INVITE. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
