    "description": "List guild invites. Uses the fixed catalog operation list_guild_invites; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:read. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): MANAGE_GUILD. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
    "execution": undefined,
    "icons": undefined,
