    "description": "Revoke an invite. Uses the fixed catalog operation invite_revoke; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:destructive. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): MANAGE_CHANNELS for the invite channel. Destructive behavior: this can remove or replace Discord or persisted state; guarded Discord calls require an exact unexpired preview token. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
