    "description": "List application commands in a guild. Uses the fixed catalog operation list_guild_application_commands; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: mcp:read. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): none at guild level; the application must be authorized to manage its own commands. Required OAuth scope(s), when using OAuth2: applications.commands.update. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
