    "description": "Publish the exact guild command set. Uses the fixed catalog operation bulk_set_guild_application_commands; set previewOnly for guarded calls. Required local scope: bot:admin. Required Discord guild permissions (bot auth): none at guild level; the application must be authorized to manage its own commands. Required OAuth scope(s), when using OAuth2: applications.commands.update. Destructive behavior: this can remove or replace Discord or persisted state; guarded Discord calls require an exact unexpired preview token. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
