    "description": "Apply an exact published blueprint plan with a bound preview token and durable resume journal. Required local scope: server:apply. Required Discord guild permissions: MANAGE_ROLES, MANAGE_CHANNELS, and/or MANAGE_GUILD according to the planned actions; hierarchy applies. Destructive behavior: this can remove or replace Discord or persisted state; guarded Discord calls require an exact unexpired preview token. On Discord 403, call discord_permissions_explain; do not retry unchanged arguments.",
